    {
      "id": 1782,
      "q": 8,
      "section": "General Aptitude",
      "text": "The sum of ages of A and B is 45 years. 5 years from now, the ratio of their ages will be 4:5. Find the current age of A.",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "15 years",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "20 years",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "25 years",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "30 years",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "solution": "Let A&#39;s age = x, B&#39;s age = 45-x. After 5 years: (x+5)/(50-x) = 4/5. 5x+25 = 200-4x. 9x = 175. x = 15."
    },
